# 假期英语长难句：邮件精选

> 用途：结合你日常物流、付款、发票、FedEx 对账工作做英语精读。
> 
> 建议方法：先自己划分 **主干 / 从句 / 非谓语 / 介词短语 / 逻辑连接词**，再翻译。暂时不附答案，避免一开始就看到解析。

## 1. 付款条件与系统流程

> We only can pay after the invoice is approved in Coupa (depend on when approver approve these invoices) and no integration issue to SAP, and also checked with treasury team. After all settled, then we can arrange the payment.

### 分析任务
- 找出 `after` 引导的时间关系。
- 判断 `depend on ...` 在规范英语中应该怎样处理。
- 分析 `and` 实际连接了哪些条件。
- 尝试把原句改写成更规范的商务英语，但不要改变原意。

---

## 2. 为什么尚未到期仍可能影响业务

> This is new Air forwarder supported Oplink Data Center shipment from Jun 2026, the invoice added in PNP in Sep for shipment invoice in Jun and Jul 2026. Thus, it reached credit amount in forwarder internal system, then impact to the available flight capacity to be allocated for Oplink shipments.

### 分析任务
- 这其实是多个完整意思被逗号连接起来，尝试拆句。
- 分析 `to be allocated for Oplink shipments` 修饰什么。
- 理解 `Thus` 和 `then` 分别表达什么逻辑。
- 注意原邮件英语并不完全规范，试着修正。

---

## 3. FedEx FCA 运费改账

> The shipments listed on invoice 9-560-56311 are under FCA terms, so the freight charges should be paid by the customer. Could you please check why the charges were rejected by the customer? The charges were subsequently returned to FedEx account 242552180, which cannot be used for payment. If there is no issue with the charges, please ask the customer to provide the correct FedEx billing account. I will then complete the LOA to have the charges rebilled to the account provided by the customer.

### 分析任务
- `listed on invoice ...` 为什么不是谓语？
- `which cannot be used for payment` 的先行词是什么？
- 分析 `If there is no issue with...` 条件从句。
- 重点理解 `have the charges rebilled` 的 **have + 宾语 + 过去分词** 结构。
- `provided by the customer` 修饰哪个名词？

---

## 4. 银行 cut-off time 与付款

> It is already too late and past the bank’s cut-off time, so the bank is no longer able to process the payments below today.

### 分析任务
- 找出全句主干。
- `past the bank's cut-off time` 在句中是什么成分？
- 为什么用 `no longer` 而不是简单的 `cannot`？
- `so` 前后是什么逻辑？

---

## 5. Treasury 节后资金安排

> From treasury side, the payment can be processed after holiday. We will arrange the necessary funding based on the payment run. Please let treasury know the amount and date in advance.

### 分析任务
- `From treasury side` 在整句话中承担什么作用？
- `can be processed` 是什么语态？为什么付款场景经常使用被动语态？
- `based on the payment run` 修饰什么？
- 区分 `fund / funding / payment`。

---

## 6. FedEx 发票争议渠道

> If you have concerns about an invoice, you could raise dispute via FedEx Billing Online, which offers a range of common dispute type and reasons, making your selection effortless.

### 分析任务
- `If` 引导什么从句？
- `which` 的先行词是什么？
- `making your selection effortless` 为什么用 `-ing`？其逻辑主语是什么？
- 尝试判断 `raise dispute`、`dispute type` 在规范英语中是否需要调整。

---

## 7. 欧盟低价值进口规则变化

> From July 1, 2026, new EU import rules apply. Goods valued below €150 may incur duties, and additional data will be required.

### 分析任务
- `valued below €150` 是什么结构？修饰什么？
- 为什么这里是 `may incur duties`？`may` 表示什么？
- `will be required` 为什么使用被动语态？
- 比较 `duty`、`duties`、`tax`、`charges`。

---

## 8. FedEx 账单信息变更规则

> Effective 3 June 2026, FedEx T&Cs will be presented in the PEACE payment portal prior to checkout. Customers are required to review and acknowledge them via a mandatory checkbox before completing payment.

### 分析任务
- `Effective 3 June 2026` 为什么没有谓语仍然可以放句首？
- `will be presented` 与 `are required` 分别是什么结构？
- `prior to checkout` 和 `before completing payment` 有什么区别？
- `review and acknowledge them` 中 `them` 指什么？

---

## 9. 发票缺少付款信息及其影响

> We have noticed that the following invoices do not contain the invoice submission date or payment date. Could you kindly clarify why these details are missing? Your feedback will help us ensure proper reconciliation and avoid any delays in processing.

### 分析任务
- `We have noticed that ...` 中 `that` 从句是什么成分？
- `why these details are missing` 为什么不是疑问句语序？
- 分析 `help us ensure ... and avoid ...`。
- `delays in processing` 中 `in` 如何理解？

---

## 10. 清关失败、退运与税费争议

> Shipment did not reach the destination due to customs clearance issues. The customer claims the shipment was replaced with AWB 445983129227, and since the original shipment was not cleared, the customer will not pay the destination duty and tax for the returned shipment.

### 分析任务
- 比较 `due to` 与 `since`：为什么一个后面接名词，一个后面接完整句子？
- `claims (that) the shipment was replaced...` 中省略了什么？
- `since the original shipment was not cleared` 是什么从句？
- `returned shipment` 中 `returned` 是什么形式、什么作用？

