# Bonus：适合整段精读的一封邮件

下面这组邮件内容特别适合练习，因为同时包含 **条件、时间、原因、被动语态、付款术语和逻辑衔接**：

> Currently 7/8 invoice is under Yin Xu’s role, some items are still confirming the vendor code, and the net due in fall in Oct. We only can pay after the invoice is approved in Coupa (depend on when approver approve these invoices) and no integration issue to SAP, and also checked with treasury team. After all settled, then we can arrange the payment.
>
> The expense occurred in June and July, but why the PNP report generated in 20260831 and invoice issued in September, which caused the invoice not due, the due date fall in October, thanks. (net due date = invoice date + payment term)

## 整篇分析建议

1. 先不要翻译，圈出所有谓语动词。
2. 按“一个核心谓语 = 一个意群”的思路切句。
3. 标记连接词：`and / but / after / when / which`。
4. 找出所有被动语态：`is approved / generated / issued ...`。
5. 判断每个 `and` 到底连接单词、短语还是句子。
6. 把不规范的邮件英语改成标准商务英语。
7. 最后重新翻译整段，重点保留原文的业务逻辑，而不是逐词直译。

